# 8. Important: Size Can Depend on the System

Do not assume that every C++ compiler uses exactly the same size for every type.

For example:

```cpp
sizeof(int)
sizeof(long)
sizeof(long long)
```

can be used to check the size on the current system.

Example:

```cpp
cout << sizeof(int) << endl;
cout << sizeof(long) << endl;
cout << sizeof(long long) << endl;
```

`sizeof` returns the size in **bytes**.

